                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Genuinely, screw you, Alawar. Sure, we should hardly expect a shovelware publisher to give any sort of damn about players, but breaking the language selection also means YOU GUYS lose a bunch of money on translators, at least assuming you're not lying about the languages listed on the store page. Setting the language in the Steam game properties doesn't work, specifying it in the launch instructions doesn't work, changing the damn game.xml file doesn't work. And this is a known issue since 2017 that you've done absolutely nothing to even acknowledge, let alone fix what is almost certainly a very simple issue. So listing all those languages is false advertising. I hope you have an awful day, thank you.",
